version 1.3c or, at your option, any later version.

The latest version of the license is available at
https://www.latex-project.org/lppl.txt

The work has LPPL maintenance status "maintained". The Current Maintainer is
Andreas Willibald Weber.

The work consists of the source files kanban.dtx and kanban.ins; build.lua,
README.md, CONTRIBUTING.md, RELEASING.md, CHANGELOG.md, and LICENSE; the
example files kanban-example.tex, kanban-modes-example.tex,
kanban-deadlines-example.tex, kanban-date-formats-example.tex,
kanban-palette-example.tex, kanban-columnsep-example.tex,
kanban-break-example.tex, and kanban-landscape-example.tex; the files in the
testfiles directory; and the derived files kanban.sty and kanban.pdf.
